      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is recorded in a loop. I think theoretically, the recorded value here will be the last one before `board_set_active_charge_port` succeeds, but the end of this interval is recorded unconditionally, which makes this interval hard to reason about.\n\nMaybe more importantly, when this is recorded, `charge_manager_refresh` may have been looping for a while. I think what we really want to record is when `charge_manager_refresh` is first called. I\u0027d put this at the beginning of the function, outside the loop, unconditionally.",
